  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate-Resilient Reconstruction after Flooding in Kerala (AM)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Klimaresilienter Wiederaufbau nach Flutkatastrophe in Kerala (BM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2018 and 2019, there were persistent heavy rainfall events and severe flooding in Kerala. The aim of the project is to rebuild the road infrastructure in a climate-resilient manner. The accompanying measure finances studies to (i) identify local climate risks so that they can be better taken into account in the planning/implementation of road construction and (ii) identify innovative materials to strengthen the resilience of roads to extreme weather events when they are built.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">In 2018 und 2019 kam es verharrenden Starkregenereignissen und schweren &#xdc;berschwemmungen in Kerala. Ziel des Vorhabens ist es, die Stra&#xdf;eninfrastruktur klimaresilient wieder aufzubauen. Die Begleitma&#xdf;nahme finanziert Studien um (i) lokale Klimarisiken zu identifizieren damit sie bei der Planung/ Umsetzung im Stra&#xdf;enbau besser ber&#xfc;cksichtigt werden und (ii) innovative Materialien zu identifizieren, die die Widerstandsf&#xe4;higkeit der Stra&#xdf;en gg&#xfc;. Extremwetterereignissen st&#xe4;rken sollen, wenn sie verbaut werden.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2018 and 2019, there were persistent heavy rainfall events and severe flooding in Kerala. The aim of the project is to rebuild the road infrastructure in a climate-resilient manner. The accompanying measure finances studies to (i) identify local climate risks so that they can be better taken into account in the planning/implementation of road construction and (ii) identify innovative materials to strengthen the resilience of roads to extreme weather events when they are built.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Wiederaufgebaute St</narrative>
  </description>
